Subject: [PATCH 1/4] =?UTF-8?q?perf(hole2):=20Phase=201=20=E2=80=94=20pool?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20bullets/orbs,=20GPU-transform=20positions,=20ring-buffer=20t?=
